<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal">Thank you for working hard to organize your upcoming blood drive.<b>
</b>Your blood drive plays an important role during this time to ensure there
are no delays in medical treatment for patients in need.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">The leaves may be changing but the need for blood never does. Help us ensure a steady supply by inspiring your community to donate. Encourage friends, family and co-workers to join you in making a lifesaving difference!</p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">When donors come to give blood Oct. 1-31, 2024, they will receive a $10 e-gift card to a merchant of their choice!*</p>

<p class="MsoPlainText"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">As you continue the work to make your drive a success –
remember to use these tips:<o:p></o:p></p>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal"><b>Share
     the attached email</b> about these exciting incentives to
     recruit more blood donors!<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Fill
     your schedule.</b> Use these tools to recruit blood donors and schedule
     them using the <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/mydrives.html/home">Blood
     Drive Management Portal.</a><o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Encourage
     donors to schedule a donation for a friend.</b> Each additional donor
     scheduled means more lives saved!</li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach
out – I’m always here to help!<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal">IMPORTANT: Donors
MUST have a valid email address on file to receive their reward.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span></b><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">All the best, <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">{Account Manager Name}</span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.25in; background: white;"><br></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:16.8pt;margin-left:
0in;background:white"><i style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(50, 49, 48); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">*Presenting donors who receive this offer and
present to donate during the applicable promotional time frame are eligible to
receive the above described e-gift card(s). This offer is non-transferable and
not redeemable for cash. Limit one (1) per presenting donor unless otherwise
indicated. If a presenting donor qualifies for multiple offers, the donor will
only receive the higher offer unless otherwise indicated. Instructions on how
to redeem the gift card will be emailed to the address listed on the presenting
donor’s American Red Cross donor profile approximately thirty (30) days after
attempted donation(s). All gift cards are subject to individual merchant terms
and conditions, and all trademarks are property of their respective owners.
Merchants and offers are subject to change. No substitutions by presenting
donors. American Red Cross is not responsible for lost, damaged, corrupted or
stolen gift cards and may replace any such cards at its sole discretion. Any
questions or problems in connection with redeeming gift cards must be directed
to the merchant.</span></i></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:8.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
